    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_03",
      "hash64": "05FBEED5E6CC8774",
      "text": "Oh my gosh, listen to this. Remember that guy\\nfrom the cafeteria?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_04",
      "hash64": "05FBEDD5E6CC85C1",
      "text": "I ran into him again in the entrance hall, so I\\nasked him to battle...but he said no![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_05",
      "hash64": "05FBECD5E6CC840E",
      "text": "He was like, “What’s the point? You’re a\\nChampion and a battle whiz—you’d wreck me!”[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_06",
      "hash64": "05FBEBD5E6CC825B",
      "text": "I don’t get what he meant! I mean, you can have\\nfun battling even if you lose, right?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "AA608DC26FF612D9",
      "text": "Yeah, you can",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "AA608AC26FF60DC0",
      "text": "Winning’s nice, though...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_07a",
      "hash64": "F790D2772D7ED58B",
      "text": "For real! I mean, sure, no one loves losing, but\\nit’s definitely not pointless. It teaches you stuff![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_07b",
      "hash64": "F790D3772D7ED73E",
      "text": "Yeeeah, I guess so... Obviously I’d rather win than\\nlose, but I just think it’s better to go into things\\r\\nwith a “losing can be fun, too” attitude![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_08",
      "hash64": "05FBE9D5E6CC7EF5",
      "text": "Man... Pokémon battles can get so complicated\\nsometimes.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_09",
      "hash64": "05FBE8D5E6CC7D42",
      "text": "Oh, and I wish he hadn’t called me a whiz!\\nI work hard at this stuff. It’s not like it all just\\r\\ncomes naturally to me![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_10",
      "hash64": "05F86BD5E6C97304",
      "text": "Like, throwing Poké Balls obviously doesn’t come\\nnaturally to me, for one thing...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_11",
      "hash64": "05F86CD5E6C974B7",
      "text": "I think I need a mental reset. I’m gonna go find\\nsomeone to battle![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_rival_c_12",
      "hash64": "05F86DD5E6C9766A",
      "text": "See you soon, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
